  "limitations": [
    "Mechanical operation support is not content correctness, semantic saved, or all-requirements completion; a semantically wrong no_change is not auto corrected.",
    "Only recognizable invalid final answer envelopes can enter C correction. Malformed/truncated/unsafe ambiguous action responses remain explicit failures.",
    "At most one correction entry in the original public-turn capacity; its memory/read loop may consume remaining calls. Both protocol and actual tool wrapper prohibit business replay.",
    "No arbitrary write-crash exactly-once guarantee, CAS, cross-record transaction, or semantic deduplication. Closed-turn process reopen is covered.",
    "Small-bank ordinary-body prefill reads all actual current-owner records and charges measured reads; scalability/retrieval selection is not established.",
    "Only the explicitly measured checkpoint/Store observation boundaries are aggregated. Physical I/O and ordinary write CPU remain unknown.",
    "Archive historical access remains lawful owner-scoped; Retained has no archive/source-bank/history-tool projection. Audit persistence is not Host permission.",
    "B0/B1/C are new v3 recipes; common explicit receipt-label request projection and ordinary exact READ change this common recipe, not legacy default behavior."
  ],
